              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-bottom' value='24' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='55' forceUpdate='true' h='3667' id='11' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='90200' x='4900' y='6867'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontsize='36'>Filthy Rich</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3200' id='12' type-v2='text' w='90200' x='4900' y='10534'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontsize='15'>Do wealthy nations structurally emit more CO2? The statistical stress-test of the global economy.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-bottom' value='24' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='52' h='3467' id='13' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='90200' x='4900' y='13734'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3467' id='14' type-v2='text' w='90200' x='4900' y='13734'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#595959' fontsize='12'>Felipe Sebben | Data: World Bank</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-top' value='16' />
                  <format attr='margin-right' value='4' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='16' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='1' h='67' id='15' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='90200' x='4900' y='18800'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d7d7d7' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='3800' id='16' type-v2='text' w='90200' x='4900' y='18867'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontsize='20'>Signal and the Noise</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='16' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8067' id='17' type-v2='text' w='90200' x='4900' y='22667'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize='11'>At first glance, the data tells a simple, damning story: money burns carbon. When splitting the world by median GDP, the &quot;Higher Income&quot; club emits, on average, </run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>5.44 tons</run>
              <run fontsize='11'> more per capita than the rest.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='11'>Yet averages hide as much as they reveal. If we consider the variance, a resource-rich developing nation can easily out-pollute a Nordic economy. This raises a question of </run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>External Validity</run>
              <run fontsize='11'>: Is this 5.4-ton gap a universal economic truth, or merely an accident of which countries reported data this year?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='16' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='226' h='16667' id='18' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='90200' x='4900' y='30734'>
            <zone fixed-size='555' h='14001' id='19' is-fixed='true' name='Jitter | Distribution | CO2 Per Capita ' show-title='false' w='88600' x='5700' y='31267'>
              <layout-cache minheight='230' minwidth='192' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-right' value='16' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='24' />
              <format attr='padding' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='1' h='67' id='26' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='90200' x='4900' y='47401'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d7d7d7' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3800' id='27' type-v2='text' w='90200' x='4900' y='47468'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontsize='20'>Stress-Testing Reality</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='16' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='33132' id='29' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='90200' x='4900' y='51268'>
            <zone fixed-size='369' forceUpdate='true' h='31532' id='28' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='38500' x='4900' y='51268'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontsize='11'>To separate the economic signal from the statistical noise, we cannot rely on a single calculation. We must generalize.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>We ran a </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Bootstrap Simulation</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>, effectively reshuffling the global economy </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>3,000 times</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>. In each simulation, we allowed the definition of &quot;Rich&quot; and &quot;Poor&quot; to shift, testing how stable the gap really is.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>The Veredict: </run>
                <run fontsize='11'>The pattern holds. In 95% of simulated scenarios, the emissions gap falls between </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>4.3</run>
                <run fontsize='11'> and </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>7.0 tons</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>. The observed difference is not a fluke – it is a robust feature of the global economy.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-right' value='16' />
                <format attr='margin-bottom' value='16' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='31532' id='31' name='Histogram | Bootstrap' show-title='false' w='51700' x='43400' y='51268'>
              <layout-cache has-max-size-h='true' has-max-size-w='true' maxheight='708' maxwidth='581' minheight='708' minwidth='581' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='24' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='185' h='12333' id='32' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='90200' x='4900' y='84400'>
            <zone h='10199' id='34' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='29000' x='6500' y='85467'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1533' id='35' type-v2='text' w='28200' x='6500' y='85467'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true'>Data Source</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='8' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='3267' id='37' type-v2='text' w='28200' x='6500' y='87000'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run>• </run>
                  <run bold='true'>Timeframe:</run>
                  <run> To maximize global coverage (~190 countries), we used the most recent available year for each nation, ranging from 2014 to 2024.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='60' h='4267' id='38' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='28200' x='6500' y='90267'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run>• </run>
                  <run bold='true'>Scope:</run>
                  <run> Emissions are </run>
                  <run bold='true'>territorial</run>
                  <run> (production-based) and exclude Land-Use Change, and Forestry (LULUCF) to focus on industrial/energy footprints.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='1000' id='36' type-v2='text' w='28200' x='6500' y='94534'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run>• </run>
                  <run bold='true'>Origin: </run>
                  <run>World Bank Development Indicators (WDI).</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-right' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='10199' id='39' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='28600' x='35500' y='85467'>
              <zone h='1533' id='40' type-v2='text' w='27000' x='36300' y='85467'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true'>Definitions and Cleaning</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='8' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='4267' id='41' type-v2='text' w='27000' x='36300' y='87000'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run>• </run>
                  <run bold='true'>Grouping:</run>
                  <run> Countries were divded into &quot;Higher&quot; and &quot;Lower&quot; income based on the </run>
                  <run bold='true'>Global Median GDP (PPP)</run>
                  <run> of the sample. This threshold is dynamic and recalculated during simulation.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='3000' id='42' type-v2='text' w='27000' x='36300' y='91267'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run>• </run>
                  <run bold='true'>Outliers:</run>
                  <run>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true'>Palau</run>
                  <run> was excluded from the dataset as a statistical outlier (&gt; 78 tons/capita) to prevent skewing the point estimates.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-right' value='8' />
                <format attr='margin-left' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='10199' id='43' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='29400' x='64100' y='85467'>
              <zone h='1533' id='44' type-v2='text' w='28600' x='64900' y='85467'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true'>Statistical Method</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='8' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='3267' id='45' type-v2='text' w='28600' x='64900' y='87000'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run>• </run>
                  <run bold='true'>Approach:</run>
                  <run> We used </run>
                  <run bold='true'>Non-Parametric Bootstrapping</run>
                  <run> (3,000 iterations) to estimate the uncertainty of the emissions gap.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4533' id='46' type-v2='text' w='28600' x='64900' y='90267'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run>• </run>
                  <run bold='true'>Why:</run>
                  <run> This method accounts for the high variance in the data and the sensitivity of the median-split threshold, providing a robust 95% Confidence Interval for the true structural difference.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-left' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='padding' value='16' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#fafafa' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='padding' value='48' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{5F7A4AD4-92DC-464A-B889-A691ACA1EB15}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
  <windows source-height='51'>
    <window class='worksheet' name='Jitter | Distribution | CO2 Per Capita '>
      <cards>
        <edge name='left'>
          <strip size='160'>
            <card type='pages' />
            <card type='filters' />
            <card type='marks' />
